{"name":"走马灯","description":"走马灯是在同一内容区域轮流展示多张幻灯片的轮播组件 · 首页宣传内容或新手引导可用走马灯切换多张幻灯片。重要信息不能只放在后面；自动播放时必须允许暂停，并提供当前位置和切换入口。","quote":"首页大图想几张轮着播，自动切换，还能点左右箭头。","agentPrompt":"请把手机商品图做成可手动控制的走马灯，显示当前张数、前后按钮和缩略图，滑动与键盘也能切换。默认不要自动播放；验证首尾边界、图片加载失败和 1 张图片时的状态。","html":"<div class=\"detail-body detail-entry-carousel\"><section class=\"detail-hero\" id=\"detail-hero\"><div class=\"dh-head\"><h1>走马灯<span>Carousel</span></h1></div><div class=\"dh-quote\"><span class=\"dh-quote-label\">你可能会说</span><p class=\"dh-quote-text\">首页大图想几张轮着播，自动切换，还能点左右箭头。</p></div><div class=\"dh-tagline\"><strong class=\"dh-summary-lead\">走马灯是在同一内容区域轮流展示多张幻灯片的轮播组件</strong><span class=\"dh-summary-separator\" aria-hidden=\"true\">·</span><span>首页宣传内容或新手引导可用走马灯切换多张幻灯片。重要信息不能只放在后面；自动播放时必须允许暂停，并提供当前位置和切换入口。</span></div><div class=\"dh-demo\"><div class=\"dh-demo-viewport\"><div class=\"dh-demo-inner\"><div class=\"crs-live\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"crs\" id=\"crs1\" checked><input type=\"radio\" name=\"crs\" id=\"crs2\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"crs\" id=\"crs3\"><div class=\"crs-view\"><div class=\"crs-track\"><div class=\"crs-pic\" style=\"background:url(&#x27;/vibe-hub/source/assets/slide-summer.png&#x27;) center/cover\">夏季新品发布会</div><div class=\"crs-pic\" style=\"background:url(&#x27;/vibe-hub/source/assets/slide-city.png&#x27;) center/cover\">城市巡展报名中</div><div class=\"crs-pic\" style=\"background:url(&#x27;/vibe-hub/source/assets/slide-forest.png&#x27;) center/cover\">森林团建回顾</div></div><label class=\"crs-arr l a1\" for=\"crs3\">‹</label><label class=\"crs-arr r a1\" for=\"crs2\">›</label><label class=\"crs-arr l a2\" for=\"crs1\">‹</label><label class=\"crs-arr r a2\" for=\"crs3\">›</label><label class=\"crs-arr l a3\" for=\"crs2\">‹</label><label class=\"crs-arr r a3\" for=\"crs1\">›</label></div><div class=\"crs-nav\"><label for=\"crs1\"></label><label for=\"crs2\"></label><label for=\"crs3\"></label></div></div></div></div></div></section><div class=\"lesson-extras\"><section class=\"lesson-agent-prompt\" aria-labelledby=\"lesson-agent-title\"><h2 id=\"lesson-agent-title\">你可以这样告诉 AI Agent</h2><blockquote><span class=\"lesson-agent-quote\" aria-hidden=\"true\">“</span><p>请把手机商品图做成可手动控制的走马灯，显示当前张数、前后按钮和缩略图，滑动与键盘也能切换。默认不要自动播放；验证首尾边界、图片加载失败和 1 张图片时的状态。</p></blockquote></section></div><div class=\"usage-grid\"><div class=\"usage-box use\"><h3><span class=\"mark\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m5 12.5 4.2 4.2L19 7\"></path></svg></span>什么时候用</h3><ul><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">首页 <b>Banner 轮播</b>：运营活动、主推内容</div><div class=\"mk \"><div style=\"width:100%;height:32px;border-radius:5px;background:linear-gradient(120deg,#7fb2ff,#165dff);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#fff;font-size:12px\">夏季新品发布会</div><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:center;gap:3px;width:100%\"><i style=\"width:10px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:var(--brand)\"></i><i style=\"width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#c9cdd4\"></i><i style=\"width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#c9cdd4\"></i></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\"><b>新手引导</b>：分步骤介绍核心功能</div><div class=\"mk \"><div style=\"width:100%;height:32px;border-radius:5px;background:linear-gradient(120deg,#8e6ce8,#722ed1);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#fff;font-size:12px\">第 2 步 · 邀请团队成员</div><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:center;gap:3px;width:100%\"><i style=\"width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#c9cdd4\"></i><i style=\"width:10px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:var(--brand)\"></i><i style=\"width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#c9cdd4\"></i></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\"><b>商品多图</b>：左右切换看不同角度</div><div class=\"mk \"><div class=\"mk-row \"><span style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:20px;height:15px;border-radius:4px;background:linear-gradient(150deg,#9ec8ff,#165dff);color:#fff;font-size:12px;flex:none\"></span><span style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:44px;height:32px;border-radius:4px;background:linear-gradient(150deg,#9ec8ff,#165dff);color:#fff;font-size:12px;flex:none\">商品图</span><span style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:20px;height:15px;border-radius:4px;background:linear-gradient(150deg,#9ec8ff,#165dff);color:#fff;font-size:12px;flex:none\"></span></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">内容数量保持克制，带指示点和切换箭头</div><div class=\"mk \"><div style=\"width:100%;height:32px;border-radius:5px;background:linear-gradient(120deg,#37b8a5,#0e9f8a);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#fff;font-size:12px\">3 / 3</div><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:center;gap:3px;width:100%\"><i style=\"width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#c9cdd4\"></i><i style=\"width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#c9cdd4\"></i><i style=\"width:10px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:var(--brand)\"></i></div></div></li></ul></div><div class=\"usage-box dont\"><h3><span class=\"mark\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 7l10 10M17 7 7 17\"></path></svg></span>什么时候不用</h3><ul><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">把<b>重要信息只放在靠后的轮播项</b>，未切换的用户无法看到</div><div class=\"mk bad\"><div style=\"width:100%;height:32px;border-radius:5px;background:linear-gradient(120deg,#7fb2ff,#165dff);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#fff;font-size:12px\">第 1 张</div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">轮播内容较多又没有当前位置提示，用户无法判断浏览进度</div><div class=\"mk bad\"><div style=\"width:100%;height:32px;border-radius:5px;background:linear-gradient(120deg,#7fb2ff,#165dff);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#f